flowchart LR
  browser[Browser] -->|HTTPS| proxy[Reverse proxy<br/>optional login proxy]
  proxy -->|HTTP + Remote-User| admin[ente-admin]
  subgraph dash["ente-admin"]
    admin --- state[(state volume<br/>audit.db, notify.db)]
  end
  subgraph ente["Your Ente server"]
    museum[museum]
    db[(museum's Postgres)]
    s3[(Object storage)]
    yaml[museum.yaml]
    apps[Ente web apps]
  end
  admin -->|admin API, token| museum
  admin -->|read-only role<br/>+ optional write role,<br/>two flags| db
  admin -.->|read-only, optional| yaml
  admin -->|HTTP GET| apps
  admin -->|SMTP| smtp[Mail server]
  museum --> db
  museum --> s3

  class browser muted
  class proxy auth
  class admin,museum,apps app
  class state log
  class db,s3,yaml data
  class smtp mail
  class dash z-app
  class ente z-data
